Complete the CIX ArmCB ISP integration by correcting ISP-Mem DMA
ownership, native and AArch32 private-ABI translation, provider and V4L2
lifetimes, runtime power management, checked register access and integrated
teardown. The configuration device defers until its ISP-Mem provider is
usable instead of publishing a partial camera interface. Expected camera
ordering deferrals are recorded through the driver core without vendor error
noise, and the optional ACPI reserved-memory omission remains non-fatal.

Source: cixtech/cix_opensource__isp_driver commit
3df10fc0fb44cc049094036d512a7c26282976f5.

